WEBVTT

00:01:33.920 --> 00:01:40.820
I am Hades now.
The love of Athena was meaningless.

00:01:41.290 --> 00:01:47.460
No, Hades. To us,
Lady Athena's love always represents hope!

00:01:49.330 --> 00:01:50.750
Fool.

00:01:57.430 --> 00:01:58.560
Hades...

00:02:00.470 --> 00:02:01.800
Hades!

00:02:01.800 --> 00:02:05.930
Yes... Finally, you are acting
like a warrior goddess.

00:02:25.640 --> 00:02:28.000
We three are finally together again.

00:02:28.330 --> 00:02:30.030
Yeah! Alone!

00:02:30.030 --> 00:02:31.750
I've come back from the dead!

00:02:32.570 --> 00:02:33.790
Those prayer beads are...

00:02:33.790 --> 00:02:35.810
Yeah, that's right.

00:02:35.810 --> 00:02:39.220
These prayer beads that can keep your
immortal Specters from reviving!

00:02:49.400 --> 00:02:52.710
These berries are fruit from the only
living thing in the Underworld,

00:02:52.710 --> 00:02:53.980
the goldenrain tree.

00:02:53.980 --> 00:03:00.580
Thus, they're in complete opposition to the Surplices,
created from Underworld minerals.

00:03:01.180 --> 00:03:04.620
They counteract the Specters' immortality.

00:03:05.300 --> 00:03:06.490
In other words,

00:03:07.050 --> 00:03:11.960
they're a weapon to intercept the Specters' spirits,
despite the Surplices' protection.

00:03:14.840 --> 00:03:18.590
<i>The Specters' souls can be
contained by the rosaries!</i>

00:03:19.710 --> 00:03:20.470
Sasha,

00:03:21.510 --> 00:03:25.720
I heard you erected a barrier over
the Sanctuary all by yourself.

00:03:25.720 --> 00:03:27.170
You must be tired.

00:03:27.170 --> 00:03:28.720
But everything will be okay now!

00:03:29.790 --> 00:03:30.730
Yeah...

00:03:31.360 --> 00:03:33.350
Good for you, Tenma.

00:03:33.350 --> 00:03:36.280
So, after our reunion in the Underworld,

00:03:36.280 --> 00:03:40.360
you found the goldenrain berries and
made rosaries from them.

00:03:41.180 --> 00:03:43.860
Asmita, the Virgo Saint...

00:03:44.520 --> 00:03:46.930
gave his life for me...

00:03:46.930 --> 00:03:49.870
For these rosaries... And for Sasha.

00:03:56.380 --> 00:03:58.290
Hey, Alone.

00:03:58.290 --> 00:04:00.380
What the hell is with you?

00:04:00.380 --> 00:04:03.080
The only reason I could fight until now,

00:04:03.080 --> 00:04:06.890
was because of our promise that we three
would be together again.

00:04:06.890 --> 00:04:10.390
But this is not what I wished for.

00:04:10.390 --> 00:04:15.560
Alone, would you really kill your little sister, Sasha,

00:04:15.560 --> 00:04:19.780
just like you destroyed our hometown,
without remorse?

00:04:31.660 --> 00:04:32.690
A dog?

00:04:33.370 --> 00:04:36.040
The one Alone saved two years ago?

00:04:40.130 --> 00:04:42.270
Wh-Why is it here?

00:04:42.970 --> 00:04:47.940
Tenma, that promise we made
remains very important to me.

00:04:47.940 --> 00:04:51.100
But we are no longer the same people.

00:04:51.750 --> 00:04:54.100
You want to know if I can
kill Sasha without remorse?

00:04:54.100 --> 00:04:56.580
Of course I can.

00:05:00.080 --> 00:05:02.110
This is a Holy War, after all.

00:05:03.190 --> 00:05:04.150
Sasha!

00:05:07.110 --> 00:05:10.030
<i>That's the Underworld's watchdog, Cerberus!</i>

00:05:10.030 --> 00:05:11.870
<i>And he was really that dog all along?</i>

00:05:11.870 --> 00:05:17.250
I never truly desired the Specters' revival.

00:05:17.250 --> 00:05:20.840
If your rosaries negate
their immortality, that's fine.

00:05:21.300 --> 00:05:24.010
Death is the peaceful equalizer.

00:05:24.010 --> 00:05:29.510
All the Saints, all the Specters,
Sasha, Tenma, you all,

00:05:29.510 --> 00:05:33.680
alongside every last being in the world...
To all of you...

00:05:34.460 --> 00:05:36.310
death's eternal rest.

00:05:37.520 --> 00:05:40.190
That is my duty.

00:05:45.330 --> 00:05:47.030
Shut up! Alone!

00:05:48.170 --> 00:05:52.780
I don't want to hear that from you!

00:05:56.540 --> 00:05:59.730
<i>Pegasus Meteor Fist!</i>

00:06:02.940 --> 00:06:04.300
Alone!

00:06:04.770 --> 00:06:08.800
When we were in the Underworld,
I promised I'd kick your ass. Remember?

00:06:08.800 --> 00:06:11.620
Yeah, you did, Tenma.

00:06:11.620 --> 00:06:13.100
But when I saw you today,

00:06:13.100 --> 00:06:14.810
I thought to myself...

00:06:18.810 --> 00:06:20.340
Pegasus Saint!

00:06:20.340 --> 00:06:22.310
<i>I can't move?</i>

00:06:23.770 --> 00:06:26.190
<i>If only I could move...</i>

00:06:26.190 --> 00:06:30.950
I can't respect you anymore.

00:06:32.300 --> 00:06:33.990
<i>After all,</i>

00:06:33.990 --> 00:06:37.050
<i>I'm a god, and you're but a man.</i>

00:06:44.770 --> 00:06:46.760
Big brother! Stop!

00:06:49.800 --> 00:06:50.880
What?

00:06:56.350 --> 00:06:59.770
<i>My power... being sealed...</i>

00:06:59.770 --> 00:07:01.650
<i>This is...</i>

00:07:01.650 --> 00:07:04.560
Why didn't I see this before?

00:07:05.520 --> 00:07:10.030
All of Athena's temple was covered in Athena's talismans.

00:07:10.030 --> 00:07:15.660
You will not destroy our Sanctuary further, Hades!

00:07:15.660 --> 00:07:17.640
We caught you!

00:07:17.640 --> 00:07:20.370
In the great cage cast by Athena's talismans...

00:07:20.370 --> 00:07:22.040
<i>Talisman Cage!</i>

00:07:23.490 --> 00:07:24.540
Pope!

00:07:24.540 --> 00:07:30.300
With him weakened,
you can move again, Aldebaran.

00:07:30.300 --> 00:07:34.800
Has it been over two hundred years, Hades?

00:07:34.800 --> 00:07:40.210
I see. You're one of the brats
who survived the last Holy War.

00:07:40.210 --> 00:07:42.440
You've grown old.

00:07:42.440 --> 00:07:45.380
<i>The Pope is a survivor of the last Holy War?</i>

00:07:56.410 --> 00:08:00.410
Then Athena left these talismans behind
during the last Holy War.

00:08:00.410 --> 00:08:02.150
Exactly.

00:08:02.150 --> 00:08:04.760
We could not leave Lady Athena vulnerable

00:08:04.760 --> 00:08:07.790
while she maintained the protective spell.

00:08:07.790 --> 00:08:12.670
But even we did not know
how effective it would be.

00:08:12.670 --> 00:08:15.550
Prepare for the end, Hades!

00:08:17.920 --> 00:08:18.930
What?

00:08:21.060 --> 00:08:22.510
You fools.

00:08:22.510 --> 00:08:26.560
An ancient talisman, over two hundred
years old, has no power over me.

00:08:26.560 --> 00:08:29.820
It's you who should prepare for the end.

00:08:29.820 --> 00:08:32.320
You made me kneel on the ground.

00:08:32.820 --> 00:08:37.700
You ruined my reunion with the Pegasus Saint,
and you will pay for that.

00:08:38.930 --> 00:08:40.990
<i>You've been weakened, but you still fight.</i>

00:08:40.990 --> 00:08:42.580
<i>I commend you, Hades!</i>

00:08:44.330 --> 00:08:47.230
<i>But I will not let this chance pass me by!</i>

00:08:47.880 --> 00:08:48.840
Athena!

00:08:48.840 --> 00:08:49.960
Yes!

00:08:54.680 --> 00:08:56.220
What are you planning on doing?

00:08:58.220 --> 00:09:01.970
The Pope and Athena's Cosmo
spreads through the temple.

00:09:10.180 --> 00:09:11.840
That Cosmo...

00:09:14.240 --> 00:09:16.050
Athena's temple?

00:09:27.870 --> 00:09:31.880
Wh-What? Where is this?

00:09:32.670 --> 00:09:34.380
That giant tower...

00:09:34.380 --> 00:09:39.010
Could that be the tower that seals the
Demon Stars, Hades's 108 Specters?

00:09:39.620 --> 00:09:43.390
Specifically, the land where
the Specters are sealed...

00:09:43.390 --> 00:09:46.390
Did we somehow connect to that land?

00:09:46.390 --> 00:09:48.860
That's correct, Hades.

00:09:48.860 --> 00:09:52.030
In your current weakened state,

00:09:52.030 --> 00:09:55.400
Athena and I used our powers to bring you here.

00:09:55.400 --> 00:10:01.030
With the Holy War's start, Hades sealed
his body in the Underworld.

00:10:01.030 --> 00:10:03.580
He entered the human world by transferring

00:10:03.580 --> 00:10:07.910
his mere soul into a human body, taking it over.

00:10:07.910 --> 00:10:11.350
So if we seal your soul right here, right now,

00:10:11.350 --> 00:10:13.710
the Holy War will end!

00:10:13.710 --> 00:10:18.860
Now, let's pull you from that boy's body.

00:10:21.170 --> 00:10:22.550
My soul...

00:10:25.180 --> 00:10:28.890
You really are such lovely idiots.

00:10:29.380 --> 00:10:30.690
No...

00:10:30.690 --> 00:10:34.940
Do not waste words on such a person.

00:10:34.940 --> 00:10:37.020
A woman's voice?

00:10:37.020 --> 00:10:39.990
Leave this part to us.

00:10:43.700 --> 00:10:46.080
The air is distorting.

00:10:50.010 --> 00:10:51.250
Watch out, Sasha!

00:10:51.250 --> 00:10:52.250
Athena!

00:11:11.800 --> 00:11:13.900
We meet again, Pegasus Saint.

00:11:16.400 --> 00:11:21.150
When you suddenly disappeared, I was worried.

00:11:21.150 --> 00:11:22.940
It seems as if parts

00:11:22.940 --> 00:11:26.160
of the human, Alone,
remain attached to your soul.

00:11:26.750 --> 00:11:28.290
So I, Pandora,

00:11:28.290 --> 00:11:32.290
will cut that attachment from you.

00:11:36.540 --> 00:11:38.670
What? That woman...

00:11:49.510 --> 00:11:53.810
Now, Lord Hades, please be seated in the wagon.

00:11:53.810 --> 00:11:57.000
That woman, Pandora...

00:11:57.000 --> 00:11:58.980
Pope, you know her?

00:12:00.660 --> 00:12:03.700
The woman constantly at Hades's side,

00:12:03.700 --> 00:12:06.570
who levels everything in his way.

00:12:06.570 --> 00:12:08.700
The woman who commands the Specters.

00:12:23.430 --> 00:12:25.740
A survivor of the last Holy War.

00:12:25.740 --> 00:12:30.680
That's right. My soul is always with Lord Hades.

00:12:30.680 --> 00:12:35.190
Normally, I act as the vessel's
older sister and protect him...

00:12:35.190 --> 00:12:36.870
That is my purpose.

00:12:36.870 --> 00:12:39.000
That is the real me.

00:12:40.340 --> 00:12:41.190
But...

00:12:41.190 --> 00:12:44.070
This time, an unforeseen agent has gotten in the way!

00:12:45.950 --> 00:12:52.810
In legendary times,
the goddess born from the head

00:12:52.810 --> 00:12:56.460
of Zeus, leader of all gods, was certainly crafty.

00:12:56.460 --> 00:13:01.710
I don't recall ever doing anything to you that could be called crafty.

00:13:01.710 --> 00:13:04.090
How dare you so brazenly...

00:13:05.370 --> 00:13:06.840
Wait, Pandora!

00:13:06.840 --> 00:13:08.970
What do you think you'll do to Lady Athena?

00:13:08.970 --> 00:13:11.220
I don't need your help.

00:13:11.220 --> 00:13:15.980
I knew I'd need to deal with
this woman sooner or later.

00:13:25.940 --> 00:13:28.910
What kind of goddess takes
shelter in a human body,

00:13:29.270 --> 00:13:33.120
to brazenly be born as Hades's sister?

00:13:33.610 --> 00:13:36.550
For you to degrade yourself,

00:13:36.550 --> 00:13:39.880
and then watch over Hades's incarnation
into a young boy's seemly vessel.

00:13:39.880 --> 00:13:42.380
You're a despicable piece of dirt!

00:13:42.690 --> 00:13:48.130
I do not feel that being born human
was degrading or despicable.

00:13:49.000 --> 00:13:53.180
For me, the days I spent with
Tenma and my brother, Alone,

00:13:53.180 --> 00:13:55.090
meant more than today,

00:13:55.090 --> 00:13:56.850
awakened as Athena.

00:14:01.310 --> 00:14:05.820
Is this your strategy?
To sway Lord Hades's emotions this way?

00:14:06.290 --> 00:14:08.600
I have no strategy.

00:14:08.600 --> 00:14:12.420
I only wish that I could have continued

00:14:12.420 --> 00:14:15.700
to live with my brother, Alone, and Tenma.

00:14:15.700 --> 00:14:17.710
Shameless goddess!

00:14:22.310 --> 00:14:23.460
Too bad...

00:14:24.260 --> 00:14:26.890
Pegasus Saint, again...

00:14:26.890 --> 00:14:28.220
Enough!

00:14:28.220 --> 00:14:29.410
Pandora!

00:14:32.950 --> 00:14:34.470
Lord Hades...

00:14:35.170 --> 00:14:36.520
It's over.

00:14:37.400 --> 00:14:40.850
All I wish is to return to my castle.

00:14:40.850 --> 00:14:44.110
What? I thought things were just getting started.

00:14:44.110 --> 00:14:48.150
I've learned all I needed to learn.

00:14:48.150 --> 00:14:49.610
No longer do I have business

00:14:49.610 --> 00:14:51.690
in the Sanctuary or here.

00:14:52.220 --> 00:14:53.370
Wait...

00:14:54.480 --> 00:14:56.100
Wait! Alone!

00:15:01.860 --> 00:15:03.630
You still don't get it?

00:15:04.770 --> 00:15:10.690
Neither your voice nor your fists
reach me anymore, Tenma.

00:15:12.140 --> 00:15:14.390
What do you mean? Hey!

00:15:14.390 --> 00:15:17.020
Athena, the Pope...

00:15:17.530 --> 00:15:19.140
The Gold Saints...

00:15:35.080 --> 00:15:38.250
It would be best that you hurry
back to the sanctuary and tell them...

00:15:38.250 --> 00:15:42.040
That King Hades will present a painting to the world.

00:15:51.170 --> 00:15:54.180
The sky is a canvas...

00:15:54.690 --> 00:15:57.310
It's called the Lost Canvas.

00:15:57.310 --> 00:15:59.810
Lost... Canvas?

00:16:04.060 --> 00:16:09.320
When this painting is complete,
this whole world will perish.

00:16:15.310 --> 00:16:17.240
What's going on?

00:16:17.960 --> 00:16:19.540
The sky...

00:16:27.040 --> 00:16:30.130
Right after Athena's temple disappeared...

00:16:30.130 --> 00:16:32.670
What's with this painting in the sky?

00:16:32.670 --> 00:16:36.970
This must be the work of Alone... Of Hades.

00:16:36.970 --> 00:16:41.930
He loves art, and he can use it to bring death.

00:16:42.770 --> 00:16:44.070
Crap!

00:16:44.070 --> 00:16:48.270
To be in such a dire situation,
with nothing we can do...

00:16:52.530 --> 00:16:55.150
<i>Athena... The Pope...</i>

00:16:55.150 --> 00:16:57.570
<i>Are they safe?</i>

00:17:00.160 --> 00:17:03.910
Destroy all life on Earth?

00:17:05.090 --> 00:17:07.610
It's called the Lost Canvas?

00:17:07.610 --> 00:17:08.540
Yes...

00:17:08.540 --> 00:17:12.280
This painting will eventually
fill the sky, across the world.

00:17:12.280 --> 00:17:16.800
And it will contain the souls of everyone on Earth.

00:17:20.720 --> 00:17:24.600
You know that everything I paint dies, right?

00:17:25.110 --> 00:17:29.610
On this Lost Canvas,
I will paint everything on Earth.

00:17:29.610 --> 00:17:34.350
When I complete it, everything depicted will die,

00:17:34.350 --> 00:17:37.360
and the Earth will be enveloped by peaceful darkness.

00:17:37.360 --> 00:17:40.970
You, who have been on
the receiving end of my attack,

00:17:40.970 --> 00:17:42.990
should know this well.

00:17:46.050 --> 00:17:48.040
Do you remember this portrait?

00:17:49.420 --> 00:17:52.280
I promised to finish this painting,

00:17:52.280 --> 00:17:54.510
once you'd returned as a Saint, right?

00:17:54.960 --> 00:17:58.890
I'm finally able to make the red
that I couldn't back then.

00:18:00.010 --> 00:18:01.640
True red.

00:18:07.890 --> 00:18:10.330
Alone... You...

00:18:15.080 --> 00:18:16.400
What...

00:18:16.400 --> 00:18:18.400
What are you talking about?

00:18:20.410 --> 00:18:24.660
That isn't why you painted!

00:18:26.780 --> 00:18:27.540
Fool.

00:18:27.540 --> 00:18:29.540
Violate! Come here to me!

00:18:31.630 --> 00:18:35.050
Heavenly Lone Star, Behemoth Violate, is here.

00:18:37.420 --> 00:18:38.930
From the shadows?

00:18:43.540 --> 00:18:44.680
Aldebaran?

00:18:47.680 --> 00:18:51.690
Gold Saint Taurus Aldebaran!

00:18:51.690 --> 00:18:54.820
I see! You're as powerful as they say!

00:18:54.820 --> 00:18:58.070
You retaliated pretty well for a little weakling!

00:18:58.070 --> 00:18:59.240
But...

00:19:01.580 --> 00:19:04.740
I won't allow you to interfere
with the Pegasus Saint!

00:19:05.740 --> 00:19:07.520
Go! Pegasus Saint!

00:19:08.040 --> 00:19:12.220
Only you, his former friend, can stop Hades!

00:19:12.220 --> 00:19:14.500
Thank you, Aldebaran.

00:19:15.030 --> 00:19:16.000
But...

00:19:16.000 --> 00:19:18.510
You don't have to tell me that stuff.

00:19:19.150 --> 00:19:22.310
I will stop him!

00:19:24.140 --> 00:19:25.390
A meteor?

00:19:27.310 --> 00:19:29.270
Wh-What are you? Stupid?

00:19:29.270 --> 00:19:30.430
You must be!

00:19:30.430 --> 00:19:33.810
Shut up! Stay out of it, you wuss!

00:19:35.310 --> 00:19:38.320
There's only one person I want to settle anything with...

00:19:38.320 --> 00:19:43.820
Alone! You said my voice and fists
can't reach you anymore.

00:19:45.370 --> 00:19:46.870
Then...

00:19:47.430 --> 00:19:51.010
I'll just keep hitting you until
they do reach you, Alone!

00:19:51.010 --> 00:19:52.120
Take this!

00:19:52.120 --> 00:19:54.130
I-Insolent!

00:19:58.130 --> 00:19:59.260
Tenma!

00:20:11.240 --> 00:20:12.640
Lord Hades,

00:20:12.640 --> 00:20:16.690
why did you go to the Sanctuary?

00:20:16.690 --> 00:20:19.310
I do not believe it was to fight.

00:20:19.850 --> 00:20:21.780
I shot a Saint...

00:20:22.460 --> 00:20:24.940
probably out of hatred.

00:20:27.700 --> 00:20:29.980
It was as it should be.

00:20:31.070 --> 00:20:32.460
Pandora...

00:20:32.460 --> 00:20:36.690
Did you have Behemoth shadow me?

00:20:37.710 --> 00:20:39.010
Yes.

00:20:39.010 --> 00:20:42.590
To aid you, should you have needed it.

00:20:42.990 --> 00:20:44.840
To watch over me...

00:20:44.840 --> 00:20:47.090
N-No, it wasn't like that...

00:20:51.600 --> 00:20:55.340
Like a bird in a cage...

00:21:07.650 --> 00:21:11.990
That Lord Hades went into the Sanctuary
on his own, of his own accord...

00:21:11.990 --> 00:21:16.940
He may be King of the Underworld,
but he was too reckless.

00:21:17.380 --> 00:21:18.630
Exactly.

00:21:19.280 --> 00:21:23.880
I don't think one who leads the 108 Demon Stars should be doing that.

00:21:24.390 --> 00:21:29.080
Lord Hades must have been
trying to make a clean break

00:21:29.080 --> 00:21:32.640
with his former human self.

00:21:33.020 --> 00:21:38.770
It is proof that he is still not completely
King of the Underworld.

00:21:39.450 --> 00:21:42.350
Impurities remain in his soul

00:21:42.350 --> 00:21:47.280
from his time as Alone,
with Athena and the Pegasus Saint.

00:21:48.010 --> 00:21:51.020
It may be more than Pandora can handle.

00:22:02.210 --> 00:22:04.800
What a shame, Athena...

00:22:05.530 --> 00:22:10.300
We have forever lost the chance
to return Alone to his human state.

00:22:12.080 --> 00:22:13.330
I know.

00:22:21.560 --> 00:22:26.600
Which means that we must
battle Hades to the death.

00:24:02.930 --> 00:24:10.010
Lord Hades, your soul still holds memories of Pegasus Tenma and Athena.

00:24:11.030 --> 00:24:14.800
I know what I must do now.

00:24:15.260 --> 00:24:18.960
Even if it means betraying you.

00:24:19.540 --> 00:24:22.740
It is all for you, Lord Hades.

00:24:23.860 --> 00:24:28.070
<i>The Myth of Hades</i>...
Next time on <i>Saint Seiya: The Lost Canvas –</i>

00:24:28.550 --> 00:24:30.010
Relentless Sacrifice.
